{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、毎日お疲れさまです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はどんなふうに過ごしていますか？☀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、昨日ひっくり返って着てしまった服を\n朝から戻して気合スイッチを入れて、1日が始まりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普段はすぐに戻すんですけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか昨日は、「まあいっか」とそのまま。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな日もあるよね！\nとスタートした日でした👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日もそれぞれの場所で頑張る皆さんに、\n心からガンバ！を送ります💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事の方も、お休みの方も、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分のペースで幸せな1日になりますように🌱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/31発売のFRIDAY"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メディア賞をいただきました！\nありがとうございます✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こうして形に残るのが嬉しくて、\n皆さんにその報告をできるのも嬉しくて幸せです。\nまたひとつ思い出に残る経験になりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここからもっと頑張ります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オフショットです↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mob28v3u2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobncEUQO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobzrpeuK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobdZBnJf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログが始まって、\nたくさん写真を載せられるのが嬉しいです^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして今日から"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「乃木坂46Mail」「乃木坂46メッセージ」が始まりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここでもまた色々と載せることができるので、楽しみです😌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も短めですが、\n最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も1日、お疲れさまでした🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}